<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Sept 21 totalled 131.974 million, versus a revised 133.730 million in the previous week and 129.432 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 155.774 million, versus a revised 158.522 million the previous week and 155.566 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
